# What a download of this repository carries — GitHub's "Download ZIP", the source
# archives of a release, `git archive` — is the skill, its license, the README, the
# changelog and PROMPT.md (ADR 0018).
# A clone or a fork carries everything: the gates, tests and records travel with
# anyone who develops the skill, and a pull request is held to them in CI.
/.github export-ignore
/docs export-ignore
/js export-ignore
/requirements export-ignore
/tests export-ignore
/tools export-ignore
/.gitattributes export-ignore
/.gitignore export-ignore
/gates.yaml export-ignore
/scaffold.json export-ignore
/SOURCES.md export-ignore

# The generated bundle is diffed as text but not counted as hand-written code.
/skills/thai-docx/scripts/thai_docx.js linguist-generated=true
